      "id": "modis_collection",
      "en": "MODIS is Collection 6.0 for 2020-2022 and 6.1 for 2023-2025.",
      "es": "MODIS es Colección 6.0 en 2020-2022 y 6.1 en 2023-2025."
    },
    {
      "id": "weather_regional",
      "en": "Weather values are regional means of ~55 km reanalysis cells, not conditions at each fire. Fire-weather association is not causation.",
